{"logId": "0db368e6-564e-4154-bdb7-75de6627e9fc", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 1190, "height": 1684, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "header_image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [839, 134, 1085, 256], "block_id": 0, "block_order": null, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[839.0, 134.0], [1085.0, 134.0], [1085.0, 256.0], [839.0, 256.0]]}, {"block_label": "doc_title", "block_content": "破碎之后", "block_bbox": [239, 227, 454, 283], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[239.0, 227.0], [454.0, 227.0], [454.0, 283.0], [239.0, 283.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "作者：超市部/何吉红", "block_bbox": [294, 293, 454, 314], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[293.99993896484375, 292.9999694824219], [452.99993896484375, 292.9999694824219], [452.99993896484375, 312.9999694824219], [293.99993896484375, 312.9999694824219]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "有一天傍晚，有几个年轻人抱着一件啤酒（自带的）来我们店购物，由于几个人边走边说笑，在快要到卖场入口时，啤酒不小心脱手掉在了地上，顿时啤酒洒了一地，四处漫流。几个人一时不知怎么办才好，我们的保安急忙上前询问：“怎么样，伤着没有，这里你们不用管了，进卖场吧，我们来收拾。”几个人连声说谢谢，又说对不起（大概他们觉的给我们添了麻烦），踮着脚尖，小心翼翼地离开“危险地”进入卖场。", "block_bbox": [198, 372, 473, 886], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[198.0, 372.0], [473.0, 372.0], [473.0, 886.0], [198.0, 886.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "前厅员工及临近进口的", "block_bbox": [240, 895, 471, 920], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[240.0, 895.0], [471.0, 895.0], [471.0, 920.0], [240.0, 920.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [491, 381, 973, 898], "block_id": 5, "block_order": null, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[491.0, 381.0], [973.0, 381.0], [973.0, 898.0], [491.0, 898.0]]}, {"block_label": "image", "block_content": "", "block_bbox": [1001, 608, 1138, 726], "block_id": 6, "block_order": null, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[1001.0, 608.0], [1138.0, 608.0], [1138.0, 726.0], [1001.0, 726.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "洗化区促销都闻声赶过来，见状急忙拿来卫生工具清理地面，顾客没伤着进卖场了，地面也已清理干净，按理事情本应该结束了，可偏偏却发生了奇妙的变化。店长正在巡场，闻声过来时，见我们收拾啤酒碎片，问明情况后，又对我们烟柜员工说：“等他们几个人从卖场出来时，把我们的啤酒送给他们一件。”我们虽然答应了，但心里有些不舍，又不是买我们的啤酒，干嘛要赔他们。在这几位年轻人出卖场准备离开时，我们把啤酒送给了他们，他们觉得很意外，说什么也不要，对我们的做法也有些不解。我们告诉他们说：“收下吧，没关系的，你们进店就是我们的顾客，开心购物胖东来，啤酒打了只是意外，再送给你们一件，希望你们每次来胖东来购物都是开心的，这是我们应该做的。”几个人翘起大拇指，欣然接受了，抱着啤酒高兴地走了。", "block_bbox": [197, 929, 977, 1238], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[197.0, 929.0], [977.0, 929.0], [977.0, 1238.0], [197.0, 1238.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "推车", "block_bbox": [110, 1407, 191, 1448], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[110.0, 1407.0], [191.0, 1407.0], [191.0, 1448.0], [110.0, 1448.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 13, "label": "header_image", "score": 0.7084190249443054, "coordinate": [839, 134, 1085, 256], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[839.0, 134.0], [1085.0, 134.0], [1085.0, 256.0], [839.0, 256.0]]}, {"cls_id": 6, "label": "doc_title", "score": 0.6147280931472778, "coordinate": [239, 227, 454, 283], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[239.0, 227.0], [454.0, 227.0], [454.0, 283.0], [239.0, 283.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7528202533721924, "coordinate": [294, 293, 454, 314], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[293.99993896484375, 292.9999694824219], [452.99993896484375, 292.9999694824219], [452.99993896484375, 312.9999694824219], [293.99993896484375, 312.9999694824219]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.955001950263977, "coordinate": [198, 372, 473, 886], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[198.0, 372.0], [473.0, 372.0], [473.0, 886.0], [198.0, 886.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.7742378115653992, "coordinate": [240, 895, 471, 920], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[240.0, 895.0], [471.0, 895.0], [471.0, 920.0], [240.0, 920.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.8588900566101074, "coordinate": [491, 381, 973, 898], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[491.0, 381.0], [973.0, 381.0], [973.0, 898.0], [491.0, 898.0]]}, {"cls_id": 14, "label": "image", "score": 0.6394219994544983, "coordinate": [1001, 608, 1138, 726], "order": null, "polygon_points": [[1001.0, 608.0], [1138.0, 608.0], [1138.0, 726.0], [1001.0, 726.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.958489716053009, "coordinate": [197, 929, 977, 1238], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[197.0, 929.0], [977.0, 929.0], [977.0, 1238.0], [197.0, 1238.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.583732008934021, "coordinate": [110, 1407, 191, 1448], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[110.0, 1407.0], [191.0, 1407.0], [191.0, 1448.0], [110.0, 1448.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "# 破碎之后\n\n作者：超市部/何吉红\n\n有一天傍晚，有几个年轻人抱着一件啤酒（自带的）来我们店购物，由于几个人边走边说笑，在快要到卖场入口时，啤酒不小心脱手掉在了地上，顿时啤酒洒了一地，四处漫流。几个人一时不知怎么办才好，我们的保安急忙上前询问：“怎么样，伤着没有，这里你们不用管了，进卖场吧，我们来收拾。”几个人连声说谢谢，又说对不起（大概他们觉的给我们添了麻烦），踮着脚尖，小心翼翼地离开“危险地”进入卖场。\n\n前厅员工及临近进口的\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_491_381_973_898.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"40%\" /></div>\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_608_1138_726.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"11%\" /></div>\n\n\n洗化区促销都闻声赶过来，见状急忙拿来卫生工具清理地面，顾客没伤着进卖场了，地面也已清理干净，按理事情本应该结束了，可偏偏却发生了奇妙的变化。店长正在巡场，闻声过来时，见我们收拾啤酒碎片，问明情况后，又对我们烟柜员工说：“等他们几个人从卖场出来时，把我们的啤酒送给他们一件。”我们虽然答应了，但心里有些不舍，又不是买我们的啤酒，干嘛要赔他们。在这几位年轻人出卖场准备离开时，我们把啤酒送给了他们，他们觉得很意外，说什么也不要，对我们的做法也有些不解。我们告诉他们说：“收下吧，没关系的，你们进店就是我们的顾客，开心购物胖东来，啤酒打了只是意外，再送给你们一件，希望你们每次来胖东来购物都是开心的，这是我们应该做的。”几个人翘起大拇指，欣然接受了，抱着啤酒高兴地走了。\n\n## 推车", "images": {"imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1085_256.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0db368e6-564e-4154-bdb7-75de6627e9fc/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_header_image_box_839_134_1085_256.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A02%3A43Z%2F-1%2F%2Fefb6b890b66c053e6d4fb84b630747cbd8da05316e6654265574b93df7799586", "imgs/img_in_image_box_491_381_973_898.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0db368e6-564e-4154-bdb7-75de6627e9fc/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_491_381_973_898.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A02%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2Fca7ee01f8e3a87bbb18fa40b9c869e77140e7d2e64954e1cac6d52206584d686", "imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_608_1138_726.jpg": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0db368e6-564e-4154-bdb7-75de6627e9fc/markdown_0/imgs/img_in_image_box_1001_608_1138_726.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A02%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2F3921b9a0d57670014bd3e5dc229a5d149fd1cec387b73699fff771879bd274b3"}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0db368e6-564e-4154-bdb7-75de6627e9fc/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A02%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2Ff0ba5c03fb61b927a30e2f3b8b96cac40e0bed72e4978cafa48973b9994dca0e"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//0db368e6-564e-4154-bdb7-75de6627e9fc/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T07%3A02%3A44Z%2F-1%2F%2F6000142ab768482220627d94a5c6a6ce53ec52abfae7e697694703844a9956dd"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 1190, "height": 1684}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.c